# Line endings.
#
# Store every text file as LF in the repository, no matter which OS it was
# written on. DevPilot is developed on Windows but CI runs on Linux, so
# without this rule CRLF endings leak into history and every cross-platform
# edit shows up as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-native scripts must keep CRLF to execute correctly.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary formats: git must never attempt text conversion or line-based
# diffing on these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.pyc binary
*.so binary
